From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jay Leaton <58495321+jayleaton@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 22:07:39 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 34/46] flashnext cuda: TF_FLASHNEXT_READOUT_FUSED from
 upstream #3413, a prompt pass's BF16 read-out on two fused tiles

Brings BadAd84's #3413 (upstream main 12233bee5..361f6170f, for #3392) onto qflash/int + F6: the fused down tile with the
hyper-connection norm on chip, the fused up+mix, the down tile picked over the device's SMs (7358f5c4f), their kernel
contract records and tests. Code and tests only; the receipt, recipe and changelog lines stay upstream's. Off by default.

The same idea is MiaAI-Lab's patches 0014 (PROMPT_HC2) and 0023 (SM-aware down tile) in
Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-RTX-PRO-6000-TernsorFold 57d815c; upstream's form is taken here, so no Mia code is carried.
